description	"The Astromech

Astromechs are useful companions who can quickly run to a given area and complete such objectives as planting explosives, hacking doors, consoles, and so forth. They come equipped with rocket boosters, flamethrowers, laser cutters, and other tools that become great weapons for pestering enemies. They are, however, poorly protected and can be killed rather easilly at close range.

^2Weaponry:
- Blaster Attachment (2)
- Wrist Laser ^3[CS1]
- Flamethrower ^3[CS2]

^6Equipment:
- Electrobinoculars
- Seeker Drone
- Portable Sentry Gun
- Portable Shield

^8Attributes:
- Fast Hacking
- Battery Recharge (2)
- Recharging Shields (1)
- Self Repair (2)
- Close Combat Training (2)
- 1 Reinforcement (CTF: 15s Respawn)
- Assemble (1)

^3Abilities:
- Jetpack
- Shield Dispenser [Hold Use on Allies]

^2Strengths^7: Great at whoring the objective, decent against Jedi classes, can always return to full health.
^1Weaknesses^7: Inferior in general combat, vulnerable to melee and pulses nades."